  "frontier-theme.js + echarts": "deferred. Operator correction 2026-09-05: only 4 of 14 frontier pages load ECharts, all older; the chart engine is 'write the mark, derive its ink, emit a string'.",
  "the eval harness": "environments/lattice-claims/eval/ is the origin's runner; cert-machine has its own in instruments/envs. The package and its tests came across; the runner did not.",
  "environments/lattice-claims": "pinned in instruments/wiring/PROVENANCE.json since 2026-09-05 (the whole environment, updated to session 17); the rows that were here moved there so one file is not pinned in two places.",
  "site/design/report.css + instrument.css": "ported 2026-09-05 as reference bytes in design/frontier-ref/, inlined by the two lattice-claims page builders under playground/. The site's shell, nav and gates stay cert-machine's own."
